# PSR-0b — Change-train commit log

One commit per inventory `change_train`. No cleanup, no scratch deletion, no
mixing of trains. Protected-package trains (`workspace-sdk`, `platform-core`,
`apps/api`) include an update to this log so `guard-docs` stays satisfied.

## Rules

1. Stage only paths whose inventory `psr0b_action` is `commit-with-train` or
   `regenerate-then-commit` for that train.
2. Leave `defer` and `keep-untracked-until-psr1` unstaged.
3. Regenerated `*.generated.*` must come from the generator, not hand edits.
4. Rollback: `git revert <commit>`; pre-split recovery still uses
   [`psr-0a-recovery-baseline.mdoc`](./psr-0a-recovery-baseline.mdoc).

## Commit ledger

| Order | change_train | Status | Commit | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | `documentation-cleanup` | done | `1f135aea` | SoT + PSR-0a snapshot; deferred docs left dirty |
| 2 | `sdk-generated-registry` | done | `990e8201` | Regenerated via `pnpm run generate:workspace-registry`; SDK http + membership |
| 3 | `denali-gravity-harbor` | done | `d0dd1a34` | Harbor package + gravity + guest smoke |
| 4 | `api-platform-behavior` | done | `1e3dac53` | Non-generated API + portal session cookie |
| 5 | `root-command-analysis` | in this commit | — | ROOT_COMMAND evidence + DX scripts |
| — | `local-scratch-artifact` | deferred | — | Remains dirty until PSR-1 |

## Technical detail — train boundaries

```text
documentation-cleanup
  docs/architecture/*remediation*
  docs/audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/*
  docs/workspaces/harbor/certification.md
  (NOT deferred phase/dev/standards drift files)

sdk-generated-registry
  packages/workspace-sdk/** (incl. src/http)
  packages/platform-core/**
  *.generated.* via pnpm run generate:workspace-registry
  package.json + pnpm-lock.yaml + apps/api/package.json

denali-gravity-harbor
  packages/workspaces/{harbor,denali,urban,guest-club,starter,finance-ws3}
  guest runtime/host Harbor wiring
  marketing/portal Harbor smoke

api-platform-behavior
  apps/api/src|test (non-generated)
  apps/portal/src/auth/build-session-cookie.ts

root-command-analysis
  docs/platform/ROOT_COMMAND_*
  scripts/{pre-commit-fast,test-changed,ops/psr-0a-inventory,...}

local-scratch-artifact
  root ad-hoc deletes + tmp-restart-*.mjs — DO NOT COMMIT in PSR-0b
```
